          "text": "Eid al-Fitr marks the joyous end of Ramadan, a time for celebration, reflection, and giving thanks. As we come together with family and friends, it’s also a perfect opportunity to reflect on personal growth and set goals for the future. Here at Admizz Education, we understand that education is a lifelong journey, and Eid can be a powerful motivator to embark on a new educational adventure."
        }
