          "text": "Eid al-Fitr signifies renewal and spiritual growth. This spirit of renewal can extend to your academic pursuits as well. Perhaps you’ve been considering pursuing higher education or acquiring new skills. Eid can be the impetus to take that first step towards achieving your educational goals."
